content.text:
The fault is an HTTP status rewrite at ts-travel-plan-service, and it reaches users through ui-dashboard's failing quickest-route requests.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-travel-plan-service",
      "fault_kind": "http_wrong_status_code",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT c.service_name AS caller, c.attr_http_response_status_code AS client_code, s.span_name AS callee_span, s.attr_http_response_status_code AS callee_code, count(*) AS n FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces s ON s.parent_span_id = c.span_id AND s.trace_id = c.trace_id WHERE c.service_name = 'ts-travel-plan-service' AND c.attr_span_kind = 'Client' AND c.attr_http_response_status_code = 404 GROUP BY 1,2,3,4 ORDER BY n DESC", "claim": "Travel-plan's client calls to route-plan quickestRoute show 404, yet route-plan's server spans for the same calls return 200."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_status_code, attr_http_response_status_code, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name = 'ts-route-plan-service' AND span_name LIKE '%quickestRoute%' GROUP BY 1,2,3,4", "claim": "Route-plan's quickestRoute server spans are status 200 with no error, so the callee is not failing."},
        {"kind": "log", "sql": "SELECT service_name, level, left(message, 160) m, count(*) n FROM abnormal_logs WHERE service_name = 'ts-travel-plan-service' AND level = 'SEVERE' GROUP BY 1,2,3", "claim": "Travel-plan logs SEVERE HttpClientErrorException NotFound on each failed route-plan call, about 753 times."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT date_trunc('minute', time) m, count(*) n, sum(CASE WHEN attr_http_response_status_code = 404 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) n404 FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name = 'ts-travel-plan-service' AND attr_span_kind = 'Client' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1", "claim": "The 404 rate on travel-plan's outgoing calls is steady across every abnormal minute, not a single spike."}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {"from": "ts-travel-plan-service", "to": "ts-ui-dashboard", "evidence": [
      {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, attr_status_code, attr_http_response_status_code, count(*) n, quantile_cont(duration,0.5)/1e6 p50_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE span_name LIKE '%travelPlan/quickest%' AND attr_span_kind = 'Server' GROUP BY 1,2,3,4,5 ORDER BY 1,4", "claim": "Travel-plan's quickest endpoint returns 500 Error; ui-dashboard's quickest server spans also turn Error with 500 (40 errors)."}
    ]}
  ]
}
```

